<title>ALBANIA: TABLE-Albanian June monthly CPI rises 5.41 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Albanian June monthly CPI rises 5.41 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TIRANA 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Albania's Institute of Statistics reported the following main economic indicator on Wednesday:</p>
<p> ALBANIAN INFLATION     JUNE 97   MAY 97    JUNE 96</p>
<p> Monthly CPI change     + 5.41    + 1.04    - 0.7</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr change	  +40.13    +31.95    + 9.6</p>
<p> Index (Dec 1993=100)   184.54    175.06    131.69</p>
<p>-- Tirana Newsroom +355 42 29825</p>
</text>
